			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(a)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">if to Sono NV, then to the address of Sono NV set out at the beginning of this Agreement:</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 90pt;">Attention:&nbsp;Christian Plail, Matthias R&#228;upke, and Torsten Kiedel</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

